quran[12]{c,v,t}:
  97,1,"Indeed, We revealed this (Qur’an) in the Night of Power."
  97,2,What will make you realise what the Night of Power is?
  97,3,The Night of Power is better than a thousand months.
  97,4,"The angels and the (holy) Spirit descend in this (night) by the permission of their Lord, with every (decreed) matter."
  97,5,It is (all) peace until the rising of the dawn.
  98,1,The disbelievers among the People of the Book and the polytheists would not separate (from disbelief) until clear evidence came to them.
  98,2,"(The clear evidence is) a messenger from Allah, reciting the purified scriptures,"
  98,3,containing upright commandments.
  98,4,Those given the Book did not become divided until after the clear evidence had come to them.
  98,5,"They were not commanded except to worship Allah, sincerely dedicating their devotion to Him as men of pure faith, and to establish the prayer and pay the alms due. That is the upright religion."
  98,6,"Indeed, the disbelievers among the People of the Book and the polytheists will be in the Fire of Hell, remaining in it forever. They are the worst of (all) creatures."
  98,7,"Indeed, those who believe and perform righteous deeds—it is they who the are the best of (all) creatures."
